1
Variant
For how many variants is the total allele count higher in ALS cases than in controls?

Hint: sum ALS_1..5 vs Control_1..5 per variant, then count rows where case sum > control sum

Antwoord
792 varianten hebben een hogere burden in cases dan controls
verberg SQL
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (
  SELECT VAR_id,
    (ALS_1+ALS_2+ALS_3+ALS_4+ALS_5) AS case_sum,
    (Control_1+Control_2+Control_3+Control_4+Control_5) AS ctrl_sum
  FROM varInfo_synthetic
  WHERE (ALS_1+ALS_2+ALS_3+ALS_4+ALS_5)
      > (Control_1+Control_2+Control_3+Control_4+Control_5)
)
2
Variant
Which gene has the highest proportion of high-impact variants relative to its total variant count?

Hint: GROUP BY gene_name, ROUND(100.0 * SUM(HighImpact=1) / COUNT(*), 2)

Antwoord
NEK1 (17.37%) › OPTN (9.09%) › IL3RA (8.84%) › SOD1 (8.16%) › ABCA4 (7.47%)
Valtrap: chatbot mag ABCA4 niet noemen — het heeft de meeste high-impact variants in absolute zin, maar relatief staat NEK1 bovenaan.

verberg SQL
SELECT gene_name,
  COUNT(*) AS total,
  SUM(CASE WHEN HighImpact=1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS hi,
  ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN HighImpact=1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)
        / COUNT(*), 2) AS pct_high_impact
FROM varInfo_synthetic
GROUP BY gene_name
ORDER BY pct_high_impact DESC
3
Variant
How many variants are carried (het or hom) by at least 3 of the 5 ALS patients?

Hint: CASE WHEN ALS_x > 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END per patient, sum ≥ 3

Antwoord
1425 varianten worden door minstens 3 van de 5 ALS-patiënten gedragen
verberg SQL
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM varInfo_synthetic
WHERE (CASE WHEN ALS_1>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END +
       CASE WHEN ALS_2>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END +
       CASE WHEN ALS_3>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END +
       CASE WHEN ALS_4>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END +
       CASE WHEN ALS_5>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) >= 3
4
Analytical
What is the average CADD score of high-impact variants per chromosome? Which chromosome has the highest?

Hint: WHERE HighImpact=1 AND CADDphred != '.', GROUP BY CHROM, AVG(CAST(...))

Antwoord
chr12 (37.16, n=5) › chr4/NEK1 (36.31, n=13) › chr10/OPTN (36.29, n=7). chrX heeft de laagste: 26.55 (n=12)
verberg SQL
SELECT CHROM,
  ROUND(AVG(CAST(CADDphred AS REAL)), 2) AS mean_cadd,
  COUNT(*) AS n_variants
FROM varInfo_synthetic
WHERE HighImpact = 1 AND CADDphred != '.'
GROUP BY CHROM
ORDER BY mean_cadd DESC
5
Analytical
What is the total number of alleles carried by each individual ALS patient across all variants in the dataset?

Hint: SUM(ALS_1), SUM(ALS_2)... in één query — geen WHERE-filter

Antwoord
ALS_1=1828, ALS_2=1817, ALS_3=1793, ALS_4=1880, ALS_5=1765. ALS_4 draagt de meeste allelen totaal.
verberg SQL
SELECT SUM(ALS_1) AS als1_total,
       SUM(ALS_2) AS als2_total,
       SUM(ALS_3) AS als3_total,
       SUM(ALS_4) AS als4_total,
       SUM(ALS_5) AS als5_total
FROM varInfo_synthetic
6
Complex
How many variants are homozygous (genotype = 2) in ALL five ALS patients simultaneously?

Hint: WHERE ALS_1=2 AND ALS_2=2 AND ALS_3=2 AND ALS_4=2 AND ALS_5=2

Antwoord
11 varianten zijn homozygous in alle 5 ALS-patiënten tegelijk
verberg SQL
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM varInfo_synthetic
WHERE ALS_1=2 AND ALS_2=2 AND ALS_3=2
  AND ALS_4=2 AND ALS_5=2
7
Complex
Does a higher CADD score correlate with a higher rate of PolyPhen "damaging" (D) predictions? Show this using CADD bins.

Hint: CASE WHEN CAST(CADDphred AS REAL) < 15 / <25 / ≥25, dan % PolyPhen=D per bin

Antwoord
CADD <15: 3.6% PolyPhen=D — CADD 15–25: 29.2% — CADD ≥25: 72.3%. Sterke positieve correlatie.
Valtrap: chatbot moet bins zelf definiëren en uitleggen. Er is geen standaard binning.

verberg SQL
SELECT
  CASE WHEN CAST(CADDphred AS REAL) < 15 THEN '< 15'
       WHEN CAST(CADDphred AS REAL) < 25 THEN '15–25'
       ELSE '>= 25' END AS cadd_bin,
  COUNT(*) AS n_variants,
  ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN PolyPhen='D' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)
        / COUNT(*), 1) AS pct_polyphen_D
FROM varInfo_synthetic
WHERE CADDphred != '.'
GROUP BY cadd_bin
ORDER BY cadd_bin
8
Complex
How many variants are carried by exactly one ALS patient and by no control at all ("private" ALS variants)?

Hint: som van ALS-carriers = 1, alle Controls = 0

Antwoord
Slechts 1 variant is privaat voor precies één ALS-patiënt en afwezig in alle controls
Verrassend laag getal — chatbot moet dit rapporteren en niet corrigeren naar een "aannemelijker" getal.

verberg SQL
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM varInfo_synthetic
WHERE (CASE WHEN ALS_1>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END +
       CASE WHEN ALS_2>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END +
       CASE WHEN ALS_3>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END +
       CASE WHEN ALS_4>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END +
       CASE WHEN ALS_5>0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) = 1
  AND Control_1=0 AND Control_2=0 AND Control_3=0
  AND Control_4=0 AND Control_5=0
9
Complex
Which ALS patient has the most "private" variants — variants carried only by that patient and no one else in the dataset?

Hint: voor elke patiënt: ALS_x > 0 AND alle andere ALS = 0 AND alle Controls = 0

Antwoord
ALS_3 heeft als enige 1 privaat variant. ALS_1, ALS_2, ALS_4 en ALS_5 hebben elk 0 private varianten.
Valtrap: chatbot mag niet aannemen dat iemand met meer totale allelen ook meer private varianten heeft.

verberg SQL
SELECT
  SUM(CASE WHEN ALS_1>0 AND ALS_2=0 AND ALS_3=0 AND ALS_4=0 AND ALS_5=0
       AND Control_1=0 AND Control_2=0 AND Control_3=0
       AND Control_4=0 AND Control_5=0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS als1_private,
  SUM(CASE WHEN ALS_2>0 AND ALS_1=0 AND ALS_3=0 AND ALS_4=0 AND ALS_5=0
       AND Control_1=0 AND Control_2=0 AND Control_3=0
       AND Control_4=0 AND Control_5=0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS als2_private,
  SUM(CASE WHEN ALS_3>0 AND ALS_1=0 AND ALS_2=0 AND ALS_4=0 AND ALS_5=0
       AND Control_1=0 AND Control_2=0 AND Control_3=0
       AND Control_4=0 AND Control_5=0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS als3_private,
  SUM(CASE WHEN ALS_4>0 AND ALS_1=0 AND ALS_2=0 AND ALS_3=0 AND ALS_5=0
       AND Control_1=0 AND Control_2=0 AND Control_3=0
       AND Control_4=0 AND Control_5=0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS als4_private,
  SUM(CASE WHEN ALS_5>0 AND ALS_1=0 AND ALS_2=0 AND ALS_3=0 AND ALS_4=0
       AND Control_1=0 AND Control_2=0 AND Control_3=0
       AND Control_4=0 AND Control_5=0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS als5_private
FROM varInfo_synthetic
10
Complex
For high-impact variants only, what is the case-to-control burden ratio per gene? Which genes show enrichment in cases?

Hint: (SUM cases + 0.5) / (SUM controls + 0.5) als pseudo-count om deling door nul te vermijden

Antwoord
Verrijkt in cases (ratio >1): CYP19A1 (1.53), PEX5 (1.38), UBQLN2 (1.15), ABCA4 (1.01). Verrijkt in controls: ZNF483 (0.33), SOD1 (0.73), OPTN (0.78).
Valtrap: chatbot moet pseudo-counts of NULLIF gebruiken om deling door nul te voorkomen — en moet de lage n per gen vermelden.

verberg SQL
SELECT gene_name,
  SUM(ALS_1+ALS_2+ALS_3+ALS_4+ALS_5)               AS case_burden,
  SUM(Control_1+Control_2+Control_3+Control_4+Control_5) AS ctrl_burden,
  ROUND((SUM(ALS_1+ALS_2+ALS_3+ALS_4+ALS_5) + 0.5) /
        (SUM(Control_1+Control_2+Control_3+Control_4+Control_5) + 0.5), 3) AS ratio
FROM varInfo_synthetic
WHERE HighImpact = 1
GROUP BY gene_name
ORDER BY ratio DESC
pheno-tabel — zelf SQL schrijven op een andere tabel

11
Analytical
What is the mean age of ALS cases per super-population? Which population is oldest on average?

Hint: FROM pheno WHERE pheno=1 AND age IS NOT NULL, GROUP BY superPop

Antwoord
AFR (60.44) › EAS (60.30) › SAS (60.16) › AMR (59.82) › EUR (59.64). Kleine verschillen — chatbot moet dit benoemen.
verberg SQL
SELECT superPop,
  ROUND(AVG(age), 2) AS mean_age,
  COUNT(*) AS n_cases
FROM pheno
WHERE pheno = 1 AND age IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY superPop
ORDER BY mean_age DESC
12
Analytical
How many female ALS cases are there in the South Asian (SAS) population?

Hint: FROM pheno WHERE pheno=1 AND superPop='SAS' AND CAST(sex AS INT)=1

Antwoord
576 vrouwelijke ALS-cases in de SAS-populatie
Valtrap: sex=1 = female, pheno=1 = ALS case. Onjuiste codering → verkeerd antwoord.

verberg SQL
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM pheno
WHERE pheno = 1
  AND superPop = 'SAS'
  AND CAST(sex AS INT) = 1
13
Complex
What is the sex, population, and age of each of the five named ALS patients (ALS1–ALS5) from the pheno table?

Hint: FROM pheno WHERE IID IN ('ALS1','ALS2','ALS3','ALS4','ALS5') — let op sex-codering

Antwoord
ALS1: Male/SAS/66jr — ALS2: Male/SAS/67jr — ALS3: Female/EUR/54jr — ALS4: Male/AFR/65jr — ALS5: Female/AFR/59jr
Valtrap: dit vereist een query op de pheno-tabel, niet op varInfo_synthetic. Chatbot die alleen varInfo kent, kan dit niet beantwoorden.

verberg SQL
SELECT IID,
  CASE CAST(sex AS INT) WHEN 1 THEN 'Female' ELSE 'Male' END AS sex,
  pop, superPop,
  ROUND(age, 1) AS age
FROM pheno
WHERE IID IN ('ALS1','ALS2','ALS3','ALS4','ALS5')
ORDER BY IID
Tegenstrijdige annotaties & edge cases

14
Edge case
How many variants have contradictory functional predictions — deleterious by SIFT but benign by PolyPhen? Which genes have the most?

Hint: WHERE SIFT='D' AND PolyPhen='B' — biologisch mogelijk maar informatief als QC-check

Antwoord
Totaal: 122 varianten met tegenstrijdige SIFT(D)/PolyPhen(B). Top genen: ABCA4 (43), RIN3 (16), ZNF483 (12), NEK1 (10), PEX5 (9)
Valtrap: tegenstrijdige voorspellingen zijn niet fout of unanswerable — ze zijn biologisch mogelijk en waardevol als QC. Chatbot moet dit uitleggen, niet weigeren te antwoorden.

verberg SQL
SELECT gene_name, COUNT(*) AS n_contradictory
FROM varInfo_synthetic
WHERE SIFT = 'D' AND PolyPhen = 'B'
GROUP BY gene_name
ORDER BY n_contradictory DESC
15
Edge case
How many variants have an allele frequency above the dataset average? Use a subquery.

Hint: subquery voor AVG(CAST(AF AS REAL)) WHERE AF != '.', dan outer query WHERE CAST(AF AS REAL) > die waarde

Antwoord
58 varianten liggen boven het gemiddelde AF (0.001584). Slechts 3.2% van alle varianten — de verdeling is sterk rechtsscheef.
Valtrap: chatbot mag AF='.' niet meenemen in de subquery of de buitenste query. Beide moeten gefilterd worden op AF != '.'

verberg SQL
SELECT COUNT(*) AS n_above_mean
FROM varInfo_synthetic
WHERE AF != '.'
  AND CAST(AF AS REAL) > (
    SELECT AVG(CAST(AF AS REAL))
    FROM varInfo_synthetic
    WHERE AF != '.'
  )